msgid ""
"Arrow keys move through the list, Enter chooses, Escape closes it. "
"Without JavaScript it is a plain select, which is why a list must fit in "
"a page."
msgstr ""
"Les fletxes recorren la llista, Retorn tria i Escapada la tanca. Sense "
"JavaScript és un select normal, i per això la llista ha de cabre en una "
"pàgina."

